How many in the
audience have not

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:41.940
deployed a working machine
learning system so far?

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:44.760
OK that seems like the
majority that's fine,

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:46.890
we'll covered what it involves.

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:52.340
How many of you have not
