00:03:53.997 --> 00:03:56.330
I'm not going to go into a
deep Tensorflow competitional

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:58.400
graphs and optimizations.

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:00.650
There's a machine learning
without a PhD talk that

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:02.760
does that, we'll
covered the basics

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:06.000
and we'll start a reasonably
sort of high level of algorithm

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.970
specification.

