00:24:53.224 --> 00:24:54.890
But there are higher
level APIs that you

00:24:54.890 --> 00:24:57.210
can use, like the
estimators, or what

00:24:57.210 --> 00:25:00.500
are used to be called
TFLearn, or you can use Keras,

00:25:00.500 --> 00:25:02.150
or you can use
higher level tools

00:25:02.150 --> 00:25:03.740
kits like the Datalab
tool kit here,

00:25:03.740 --> 00:25:06.640
which provides even
simpler capabilities.

00:25:06.640 --> 00:25:08.890
So if you have structured
data, here you can just say,

00:25:08.890 --> 00:25:09.937
