00:28:45.970 --> 00:28:50.190
In batch prediction, you say,
I have this set of records.

00:28:50.190 --> 00:28:51.720
I have the model.

00:28:51.720 --> 00:28:53.820
Please host the model.

00:28:53.820 --> 00:28:57.320
Run this data, batch
data, through it,

00:28:57.320 --> 00:28:58.695
