I had in the test data set,

00:29:09.720 --> 00:29:11.630
because it's a known value.

00:29:11.630 --> 00:29:14.280
Effectively, it's
batched prediction,

00:29:14.280 --> 00:29:15.900
followed by a
comparison of the target

00:29:15.900 --> 00:29:18.427
value and the predicted value.

00:29:18.427 --> 00:29:21.010
So I'm effectively showing you
batch prediction, as well Batch

00:29:21.010 --> 00:29:22.430
prediction is no different.

00:29:22.430 --> 00:29:24.940
You skip the evaluation
part of comparing results,

00:29:24.940 --> 00:29:26.690
