00:38:06.225 --> 00:38:08.240
OK, it's still running.

00:38:08.240 --> 00:38:09.720
I'll let the predictions go on.

00:38:18.455 --> 00:38:19.540
And use the existing one.

00:38:35.505 --> 00:38:37.260
OK, I think we are
running out of time,

00:38:37.260 --> 00:38:39.176
so I won't go through
