00:39:10.610 --> 00:39:12.500
That's what I want in my model.

00:39:12.500 --> 00:39:14.810
I don't want darker
squares anywhere else,

00:39:14.810 --> 00:39:16.720
because that is confusion.

00:39:16.720 --> 00:39:19.870
And this, and this, these
