One is metric units.

00:39:23.770 --> 00:39:25.180
One is imperial units.

00:39:25.180 --> 00:39:26.951
Even to an eye, it's
very hard to tell.

00:39:26.951 --> 00:39:29.200
The model actually gets it
right in most of the cases,

00:39:29.200 --> 00:39:33.025
but there are some angles
